# Context

## Why This Way
SE-P0-01 of the stateful plan. The baseline pins observed behavior
before any environment work so later phases can show what changed.
Digests came from two fresh runs in a scratch workspace; the run and
trial seeds are deterministic functions of the batch id, so the same
invocations reproduce the domain outcome.

## Gotchas
- evaluation.json and session/events.redacted.jsonl digests vary per
  run; only semantic events and final state repeat byte-identically.
- behavior_entrypoint_sha256 is the repository file digest; the store
  records the same loader hash at initializeRun.
